<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to July 28: Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle a.  Slaughter		156	    67,828     59,386</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0	     1,434	  879</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     2,662	1,348</p>
<p>2) Hogs a.  Slaughter		  0	     1,063     31,831</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 477	  314</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     5,880	1,613</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle a.  Breeding Males	   0		 167	   36</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females     112	    16,681	7,550</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
